1
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:10,064
Hello! Lanexang Assurance will show you how to report a problem or send feedback on lap.com.la

2
00:00:10,514 --> 00:00:14,154
Every piece of feedback helps us improve our service

3
00:00:16,454 --> 00:00:24,644
Step 1: Open lap.com.la on your phone or computer

4
00:00:26,244 --> 00:00:32,823
Step 2: Tap the “Report / Feedback” button at the bottom right of the screen

5
00:00:35,423 --> 00:00:39,070
The “Feedback & Report Box” window will open

6
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:45,873
It is 100% safe and anonymous: your name and email are never recorded

7
00:00:46,323 --> 00:00:48,828
Both customers and staff can use it

8
00:00:50,428 --> 00:00:54,400
Step 3: Under “Who are you?”

9
00:00:54,850 --> 00:01:02,606
choose Customer / Service user, LAP staff, or General public

10
00:01:04,406 --> 00:01:07,193
Step 4: Choose the topic type

11
00:01:07,643 --> 00:01:12,868
such as Feedback / Suggestion, or System / Service problem

12
00:01:13,318 --> 00:01:16,443
Complaint / Conduct report, or Other

13
00:01:19,043 --> 00:01:22,194
Step 5: Add a short subject

14
00:01:22,644 --> 00:01:28,760
Then describe the details: what happened, where, or your suggestion

15
00:01:29,210 --> 00:01:32,895
Fields marked with a red star are required

16
00:01:34,895 --> 00:01:42,559
Step 6: If you have photos or documents as evidence, attach them (up to 10 MB)

17
00:01:44,259 --> 00:01:47,343
Finally, tap “Send”

18
00:01:47,793 --> 00:01:51,710
That's it: your feedback is on its way to us

19
00:01:54,910 --> 00:02:00,776
For urgent help, call our 24-hour hotline 1819

20
00:02:01,226 --> 00:02:07,061
or contact us on WhatsApp at 020 9855 6666

21
00:02:08,961 --> 00:02:12,372
Lanexang Assurance: always beside you
